abstract: >-
  A reproducible implementation and staged evidence system for the DERD
  difference-of-radii waveform model, evaluated on Cepheid, RR Lyrae, and
  Delta Scuti light-curve research tasks.
keywords:
  - variable stars
  - light curves
  - Cepheids
  - RR Lyrae
  - Delta Scuti
  - reproducibility
  - waveform models
